{"id":"4cb76a48eeccf0fc","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-thm-leray-hopf.md","title":"Leray–Hopf Theorem","display":"thm-leray-hopf — Leray–Hopf Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-leray-hopf","aliases":["58-thm-leray-hopf"],"display":"thm-leray-hopf — Leray–Hopf Theorem","depends_on":["[[58-df-leray-hopf-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-leray-hopf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-leray-hopf</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-leray-hopf — Leray–Hopf Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"70d7a97bd7315c54\" href=\"?note=70d7a97bd7315c54\" title=\"58-df-leray-hopf-data.md\">58-df-leray-hopf-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_0,T,\\nu,u,p\\in V\">\\(u_0,T,\\nu,u,p\\in V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,\\nu\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\">\\(T,\\nu\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DivergenceFreeL2}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(u_0;\\mathbb R^3)\">\\(\\operatorname{DivergenceFreeL2}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(u_0;\\mathbb R^3)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LerayHopfSolution}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(u,p;u_0,\\nu,T)\">\\(\\operatorname{LerayHopfSolution}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(u,p;u_0,\\nu,T)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"70d7a97bd7315c54\" href=\"?note=70d7a97bd7315c54\" title=\"58-df-leray-hopf-data.md\">58-df-leray-hopf-data.md</a> 中已展开的二元、五元关系。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}leray\\text{-}hopf}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\operatorname{DivergenceFreeL2}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(u_0;\\mathbb R^3)\n\\land T,\\nu\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\n\\to\\exists u,p\\in V\\;\n\\operatorname{LerayHopfSolution}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(u,p;u_0,\\nu,T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}leray\\text{-}hopf}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\operatorname{DivergenceFreeL2}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(u_0;\\mathbb R^3)\n\\land T,\\nu\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\n\\to\\exists u,p\\in V\\;\n\\operatorname{LerayHopfSolution}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(u,p;u_0,\\nu,T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>结论仍为三维全空间上无外力 Leray–Hopf 弱解的有限时间存在性。公开谓词、参数顺序及定理公式不变。</li>\n<li>弱时间连续性、压力测试、初值与能量条件均在内部定义的 Assertion 中；本定理不作唯一性或经典正则性断言。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-leray-hopf-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"70d7a97bd7315c54","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-leray-hopf-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-leray-hopf-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"70d7a97bd7315c54","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{DivergenceFreeL2}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(u_0;\\mathbb R^3)$ 与 $\\operatorname{LerayHopfSolution}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(u,p;u_0,\\nu,T)$ 使用 [[58-df-leray-hopf-data.md]] 中已展开的二元、五元关系。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"u_0,T,\\nu,u,p\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"T,\\nu\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DivergenceFreeL2}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(u_0;\\mathbb R^3)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LerayHopfSolution}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(u,p;u_0,\\nu,T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}leray\\text{-}hopf}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\operatorname{DivergenceFreeL2}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(u_0;\\mathbb R^3)\n\\land T,\\nu\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\n\\to\\exists u,p\\in V\\;\n\\operatorname{LerayHopfSolution}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(u,p;u_0,\\nu,T).","display":true}],"bytes":1109,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4280","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-thm-leray-hopf.md|58-thm-leray-hopf]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["70d7a97bd7315c54"]}